Some Important Functions:

c combines its arguments into a single vector:

> data.vector <- c(1:3,5:7,9,11)
> data.vector
[1]  1  2  3  5  6  7  9 11


rep replicates its first argument as many times as specified by its second argument:

> rep(1,length(data.vector))
